Cell 1: Full pipeline in one function
python
def rag_answer(question, k=5):
    docs = retrieve(question, k=k)                                  # retrieval system
    context = "\n\n".join([doc["text"] for doc in docs])
    return rag_chain.invoke({"context": context, "question": question})   # LLM generation

The document processing (PDF to chunks to embeddings in ChromaDB) was done in Parts 1 and 2, so this function connects the retrieval and the LLM on top of it.

